# STEP 3 — PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

Ensure product description includes:

- module overview
- verified learning hours (VLH)
- credential type
- competency-based framework
- completion requirements
- transcript-style record explanation
- optional Solana verification language
- SydTek University + SydTek Scholars branding
- Goldstonian Concordance Bible (GCB) alignment

---

# STEP 4 — REQUIRED SHOPIFY CUSTOMER FIELDS

Collect the following during checkout:

| Field | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Legal Name | Registrar records |
| Certificate Display Name | Credential printing |
| Email Address | LMS enrollment |
| Student ID | Transcript tracking |
| Optional Solana Wallet Address | On-chain verification |
| Consent Checkbox | Verification acknowledgment |

